start-up and investor advice,

00:05:17.017 --> 00:05:21.288
what I learned from Wine
Library TV is the following:

00:05:21.288 --> 00:05:22.822
The true story of 
Wine Library TV was

00:05:22.822 --> 00:05:24.391
the day that I thought 
I was going to start it

00:05:24.391 --> 00:05:27.627
I thought I was going to
do something similar to QVC.

00:05:27.627 --> 00:05:30.697
