QVC or a shopping network in

00:05:30.697 --> 00:05:32.590
Europe but QVC in 
America it's a show

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:34.007
and they sell stuff 
through the TV.

00:05:34.007 --> 00:05:36.870
I thought I was going
to do the QVC of wine.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:41.708
The first episode of that show
when that camera went on and

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:44.314
that light went on I realized
that this was going to be on the

00:05:44.314 --> 00:05:46.012
internet forever.

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:48.571
And that I just didn't
want to peddle wine.

00:05:48.571 --> 00:05:53.253
I decided I wanted to be a value
to people in learning about wine

00:05:53.253 --> 00:05:55.689
because I was scared that if I
was peddling something I didn't

00:05:55.689 --> 00:05:58.225
